  `assoc`: edges onto role runs, whose outcome is a copy of the acting run's; never counted as acted on.
  `member`: edges onto experiment member runs, which never push; a winner is acted on through its synthesis run. Never counted as acted on.
  `excl`: acted-on runs whose outcome is in feedback.LEARNING_EXCLUDED_FAILURE_CLASSES; counted, never scored.
  `sweep`: merges the durability sweep has not judged yet; they resolve, so they wait.
  `nomerge`: runs that never merge; scored by capability_effectiveness's no-merge verdict rate, never at this step.
  `open`: acted-on runs with no outcome recorded yet.

